--- !u!114 &499103471
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 499103468}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - The snow has melted into rain.
    - Amadea's glow is felt stronger as we ascend.
    - Hidden in the storm is wicked, turbulent magic... the same forces that sundered
      this place an age ago.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - To find leyline terminals in a place like this...
    - ...such a thing is a testament to the will of the network's developers.
    - They took unto themselves the task of preventing the world's destruction...
    - ...time will tell if they were successful.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Nusuth.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  DialogueName: Savaphe
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 1113703462}
  CameraY: 0.55
  canvasDelay: 0
  cameraFollowOffsetLerp: 0
